<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow (1930) | Piet Mondrian</title>
<meta name="description" content="Piet Mondrian's Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow, 1930: De Stijl, Neoplasticism and why the work matters.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black&family=Archivo:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--red:#d6261c;--blue:#1d3f94;--yellow:#f5d10f;--black:#111;--white:#f6f3ea;--grey:#d9d6cf;--line:clamp(8px,1.4vw,16px)}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
body{background:var(--black);color:var(--black);font:400 1.05rem/1.55 Archivo,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif}
h1,h2{font-family:"Archivo Black",Arial Black,sans-serif;line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.01em}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:4px solid var(--yellow);outline-offset:3px}
.grid{display:grid;gap:var(--line);padding:var(--line);min-height:100vh}
.cell{background:var(--white);padding:clamp(16px,3vw,40px)}
/* Hero mirrors the painting: big red top right, small blue bottom left, small yellow bottom right */
.hero{grid-template-columns:1.1fr 3fr .5fr;grid-template-rows:3fr 1fr .45fr}
.title{grid-column:1;grid-row:1/3;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end}
.title h1{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3.4vw,3.2rem)}
.title p{margin-top:.8em;font-weight:600}
.red{background:var(--red);grid-column:2/4;grid-row:1/3;color:var(--white);display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
.red span{font:clamp(4rem,14vw,12rem)/0.85 "Archivo Black",sans-serif}
.blue{background:var(--blue);grid-column:1;grid-row:3}
.w1{grid-column:2;grid-row:3}
.yellow{background:var(--yellow);grid-column:3;grid-row:3}
.facts{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;min-height:auto}
.facts h2{font-size:clamp(1.4rem,2.6vw,2.2rem);margin-bottom:.5em}
.lead{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,1.8vw,1.5rem);max-width:none}
.lead p{max-width:52ch}
dl dt{font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:1em}
dl dt:first-child{margin-top:0}
.prim{display:flex;gap:var(--line);background:var(--black);margin-top:1em;height:48px}
.prim i{flex:1}
.why{background:var(--red);color:var(--white)}
.cta{background:var(--yellow)}
.cta a{display:inline-block;margin-top:1em;background:var(--black);color:var(--white);padding:.8em 1.2em;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
.cta a:hover{background:var(--blue)}
.cta{grid-column:2/4}.foot{grid-column:1;grid-row:3;background:var(--grey);font-size:.85rem}
@media (max-width:760px){
 .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr .4fr;grid-template-rows:auto 40vh 70px}
 .title{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:1}
 .red{grid-column:1/3;grid-row:2}
 .blue{grid-column:1;grid-row:3}.w1{display:none}.yellow{grid-column:2;grid-row:3}
 .facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cta,.foot{grid-column:1;grid-row:auto}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<header class="grid hero" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="cell title">
    <h1>Composition with Red, Blue and Yellow</h1>
    <p>Piet Mondrian, 1930</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cell red" aria-hidden="true"><span>1930</span></div>
  <div class="cell blue" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cell w1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cell yellow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</header>

<section class="grid facts" aria-label="About the work">
  <div class="cell lead">
    <h2>A large red square. A small blue square. A small yellow rectangle.</h2>
    <p>Divided by thick black lines on a white ground: the red at the top right, the blue at the bottom left, the yellow at the bottom right. Oil on canvas, painted in 1930, also listed as <em>Composition II in Red, Blue, and Yellow</em>.</p>
  </div>
